# Secrets -- never bake these into an image. Injected at container runtime
# instead (see Dockerfile's comment above CMD).
.env
*.env

# Local dev venv / bytecode
.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Training pipeline scripts + raw reference datasets -- not needed to serve
# a prediction. What IS needed: the small (~6.5MB total) *_sampled_geoms.geojson
# parcel-geometry checkpoints and local_parcels/ (~130KB), which
# services/parcels.py + services/demo_parcels.py read to power the Parcel
# Browser / Live Validation pages -- excluded from git (see .gitignore) but
# deliberately still copied into the image below (Dockerfile), since the
# deployed API is useless for parcel browsing without them. GeoJSON, not the
# *_sampled_geoms.pkl the training pipeline's own resume logic uses --
# pickle doesn't survive being read back by a different pandas/geopandas
# build than the one that wrote it (a real deploy hit this), so the .pkl
# variants are excluded below alongside the other training-only pickles.
training/eurocrops_pipeline/
training/*.py
training/*.ipynb
training/eurocrops_output/multi_country/checkpoints/*_fetched.pkl
training/eurocrops_output/multi_country/checkpoints/*_sampled_geoms.pkl
training/eurocrops_output/multi_country/scratch/
training/eurocrops_output/multi_country/*.pth
training/eurocrops_output/multi_country/*.log
training/eurocrops_output/*.json
training/eurocrops_output/*.zip
breizhcrops_dataset/

# Legacy checkpoints -- app/config.py's CHECKPOINT_PATH loads exactly one
# file (multicountry_india_custom_18class.pth, copied explicitly in the
# Dockerfile); these are historical/unused by the running app.
breizhcrops_france_9class.pth
eurocrops_france_11class.pth
multicountry_11class_at_be-partial.pth
multicountry_11class_backup.pth
multicountry_india_18class_noregions_2026-08-09.pth

# Misc
*.log
.git/
.gitignore
